修复前后（同一程序，`std::nvm` 与其余三个后端一致）：

```camel
func maybe(flag: bool, xs: int[]): int {
    if flag then loop acc = 0 for x in xs do acc + x else -1
}
func main(): int sync {
    println(maybe(true, [1, 2, 3]))     // 修复前 5，修复后 6
    return 0
}
```

